Paper title: Reversibility and Further Properties of FCFS Infinite Bipartite Matching

Blocks:
[
  {
    "block_id": "2016405925157540297",
    "title": "1. Introduction",
    "sub_firstblock": "et al. [9] and Adan and Weiss [4]. "
  },
  {
