    "sub_firstblock": "The authors thank Michael Schulte-Mecklenbeck, Thorsten Pachur, and Ralph Hertwig for the use of the experimental data analyzed in this paper. These data are a subset from a large decision-making study conducted at the Max Planck Institute for Human Development in Berlin. The authors also thank Helga Fehr-Duda, Thomas Epper, and Didier Sornette for helpful comments and suggestions on this project. This work was supported in part by the ETH Zürich Risk Center and is related to Future Resilient Systems (FRS) Module 3.1 from the Singapore ETH Centre. "
