    "sub_firstblock": "The cross decomposition and the dually-weighted cross decomposition algorithms were tested on 27 examples with 19-108 potential facilities and 65-174 customers on the road network of Switzerland. In these examples, a tolerance level $\\tau$ of $0 . 5 \\%$ for the duality gap $v ( M D _ { k } ) \\mathrm { ~ - ~ }$ $v ( S D _ { \\mu ^ { \\mathrm { b e s t } , k } } )$ was used, in step 3 the dual solution $( \\lambda ^ { k + 1 } , \\nu ^ { k + 1 } , \\mu ^ { k + 1 } )$ was altered as described in [Wentges 1993], and at most thirty iterations were carried out. "
  }
